msgstr "0.50"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:82
#: 1862984f2724455eb79c3df444a6dda1
msgid "0.25"
msgstr "0.25"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:268
#: fb6eb45c6d6c4f36adfc43f59c2d2705
msgid ""
"Connected points compare each organization's output efficiency against its "
"declared-group frontier and the pooled metafrontier; organizations A and B "
"have no within-group shortfall but remain one half as efficient against "
"pooled opportunities, organization C has both shortfalls, and organizations "
"D through F attain both represented frontiers"
msgstr ""
"连线点图比较每个组织相对于声明群组前沿与合并共同前沿的产出效率；组织 A 和 B 在群组内没有绩效不足，但相对于合并机会的效率只有二分之一，组织 C "
"同时存在两类绩效不足，组织 D 至 F 则同时达到两条已表示前沿"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:272
#: 1bad8b8958754b6eb73fa8319c3d78c9
msgid ""
"Within-group performance and pooled-opportunity comparison. The hollow "
"diamond records efficiency against declared-group best practice; the orange "
"point records efficiency against pooled best practice. The MTR label gives "
"their ratio. A connector links the two benchmark results for the same "
"organization; its length is not another decomposition component, and it does"
" not assign the difference to management, technology, or the operating "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"群组内绩效与合并机会比较。空心菱形表示相对于声明群组最佳实践的效率，橙色圆点表示相对于合并最佳实践的效率，MTR "
"标签给出二者之比。连接线把同一组织的两项标杆结果相连；其长度并不是另一个分解成分，也不把差额归因于管理、生产技术或运营环境。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:280
#: e943be975a734e10a53f811c97b0b8c3
msgid ""
"A and B reach the best practice represented within group 1, but their meta "
"efficiencies are only one half. Asking them simply to “catch up with local "
"best practice” cannot close this part of the shortfall: they are already on "
"their group frontier. Their result directs attention toward the difference "
"between represented opportunity sets, while leaving open what produced that "
"difference and whether it can be changed."
msgstr ""
"A 与 B 达到 group 1 "
"所表示的最佳实践，但共同前沿效率只有二分之一。仅仅要求它们“追赶当地最佳实践”无法弥补这部分差距，因为它们已经位于自身群组前沿上。该结果把注意力引向已表示机会集合之间的差别，同时仍然保留两个问题：是什么造成了这种差别，以及它能否改变。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:287
#: e7544ffa07bd44c580cb92feeedd5bd2
msgid ""
"C faces both dimensions. At four resource units, its service would rise from"
" two to four at the group frontier and to eight at the pooled metafrontier. "
"Its meta efficiency is therefore"
msgstr "C 面临两个维度的绩效不足。在四单位资源下，其服务量在群组前沿上会从二增加到四，在合并共同前沿上则增加到八。因此，其共同前沿效率为"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:291
#: 4659c2f6437f451bbd702c8e273877a6
msgid ""
"\n"
"0.25=0.50\\times0.50.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"0.25=0.50\\times0.50.\n"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:295
#: b2793f635fa24dbfa71b15604aa3e3f2
msgid ""
"D, E, and F attain both frontiers at their operating mixes. Their MTR of one"
" does not prove that the two group technologies are identical everywhere; it"
" only says that the matched group and meta boundaries coincide at those "
"evaluations."
msgstr ""
"D、E 与 F 在各自运营组合下同时达到两条前沿。它们的 MTR "
"为一，并不能证明两个群组的生产技术在所有位置都相同；它只表示在这些评价点上，口径匹配的群组边界与共同边界重合。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:300
#: df6f69506efe487b974d214639ae1b51
msgid ""
"As in any radial DEA analysis, a score of one concerns proportional movement"
" in the chosen orientation. It should not be silently enlarged into a claim "
"that every individual input excess or output shortfall has disappeared."
msgstr "与任何径向 DEA 分析一样，效率值为一只针对所选导向下的比例变动，不能悄然扩大成每一项投入冗余或产出不足都已消失的结论。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:304
#: f2a4468974ba4276a56b21461a72f1de
msgid "Time is part of the comparison policy"
msgstr "时期是比较政策的一部分"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:306
#: 8d0c332e552149d5bcb6039124ce836b
msgid ""
"Panel data add a second source of heterogeneity: the information available "
"at each date. The radial metafrontier account used here pools all eligible "
"study periods at both levels. Each group has one time-invariant frontier "
"formed from all of its observations, and the meta account has one time-"
"invariant frontier formed from all groups and periods."
msgstr "面板数据增加了第二个异质性来源：每个日期可用的信息。这里的径向共同前沿账户在群组层面与共同层面都合并研究期限内的全部合格时期。每个群组使用由其所有观测形成的一条时不变前沿，共同账户则使用由全部群组和全部时期形成的一条时不变前沿。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:312
#: 9de7942c3d6f466c864fe18027c4f19b
msgid ""
"This is a retrospective question: how close was each organization to the "
"strongest practice observed anywhere in the complete study window? It can be"
" valuable for ex post benchmarking, but it allows a later organization-"
"period to benchmark an earlier one. That is an intentional information "
"policy, not evidence that the earlier manager could have known or adopted "
"the later practice."
msgstr "这是一项回溯性问题：每个组织当时距离完整研究窗口内任何地点观察到的最强实践有多远？它可用于事后标杆分析，但允许后期的“组织—时期”记录成为早期记录的标杆。这是一项有意设定的信息政策，并不证明早期管理者当时能够知晓或采用后来出现的实践。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:319
#: aa46710447be4b0fb100319589c74fcd
msgid ""
"A contemporaneous frontier would answer a different question, as would any "
"other time-scoped information policy. Nor does a change in efficiency "
"against the all-period frontier identify technological progress. Measuring "
"frontier movement requires a productivity analysis with an explicitly dated "
"reference technology. The temporal policy should therefore appear in the "
"study design and reporting, not be left implicit in the data layout."
msgstr "同期前沿会回答另一问题，任何其他按时期限定的信息政策也是如此。相对于全时期前沿的效率变化，也不能识别技术进步。测量前沿移动，需要使用具有明确日期参照技术的生产率分析。因此，时期政策应出现在研究设计与报告中，不能隐含在数据排列方式里。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:326
#: 6a7d33b8f8e7440c8f42f6388936bdcb
msgid "Reporting the decomposition responsibly"
msgstr "负责任地报告分解结果"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:328
#: 9083e53ce3be4eb38c77586c4702740e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reporting only meta efficiency throws away the main analytical benefit. A "
"useful table places $E_o^G$, $E_o^M$, and $MTR_o$ side by side. Figure "
"{numref}`fig-metafrontier-decomposition-result` displays group and meta "
"efficiency as connected points and prints the exact MTR beside each "
"organization. This makes the two benchmark comparisons visible without "
"turning the MTR into a league table of managerial quality."
msgstr ""
"只报告共同前沿效率，会丢失该方法最主要的分析收益。一张有用的表应并列展示 $E_o^G$、$E_o^M$ 与 $MTR_o$。图 {numref"
"}`fig-metafrontier-decomposition-result` 用连线点图展示群组效率和共同前沿效率，并在每个组织旁标出精确 "
"MTR。这样既能看清两项标杆比较，又不会把 MTR 变成管理质量排行榜。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:335
#: 15c17a17fc514bdabea35e59c729c94b
msgid ""
"The caption and accompanying methods statement should identify the declared "
"groups, input or output orientation, returns to scale, pooled construction, "
"comparison population, and study-period information policy. Important cases "
"should be interpreted with their group and meta benchmarks, especially when "
"the pooled frontier depends on cross-group combinations. The decomposition "
"identity should hold to numerical precision, and the estimated meta "
"opportunity should never be less expansive than the matched group "
"opportunity."
msgstr "图注和配套方法说明应明确：声明群组、投入或产出导向、规模报酬、合并构造方式、比较总体以及研究时期的信息政策。重要案例应结合其群组标杆与共同前沿标杆解释，特别是合并前沿依赖跨群组组合时。分解恒等式应在数值精度范围内成立，估计的共同机会绝不能比口径匹配的群组机会更窄。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:344
#: 1654b3763e584fecb91b7c04d9331b64
msgid ""
"The labels attached to the two components require particular care. Group "
"efficiency is sometimes described informally as managerial efficiency and "
"the MTR as an environmental or technology effect. Those names overstate what"
" the model establishes. Both quantities are deterministic, sample-relative "
"comparisons. Unmeasured service quality, demand, case mix, capital vintage, "
"measurement error, and selection into groups can affect either component. "
"Group membership may itself summarize several institutional differences that"
" the decomposition cannot disentangle."
msgstr ""
"给两个组成部分贴标签时需要格外谨慎。群组效率有时被非正式地称为管理效率，MTR "
"则被称为环境效应或技术效应。这些名称夸大了模型能够证明的内容。二者都是确定性的、相对于样本的比较。未观察服务质量、需求、病例组合、资本年代、测量误差以及群组选择，都可能影响任一组成部分。群组成员身份本身也可能概括了多种制度差异，而该分解无法把它们进一步拆开。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:353
#: 502eae92f52241248df270aad5a40781
msgid "For the laboratory case, a defensible statement is:"
msgstr "对于这个实验案例，站得住脚的表述是："

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:355
#: 101e31c7b86e4e028a6e0272823407ef
msgid ""
"Organization C delivered one half of the output supported by its declared "
"group frontier at the observed resource commitment. At that operating mix, "
"the group frontier supported one half of the output represented by the "
"pooled VRS metafrontier. Its resulting meta efficiency was one quarter."
msgstr ""
"在实际资源承诺下，组织 C 的实际产出是其声明群组前沿所支持产出的二分之一。在该运营组合下，群组前沿所支持的产出又是合并 VRS "
"共同前沿所表示产出的二分之一。因此，其共同前沿效率为四分之一。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:360
#: 4008530b865a4f40ab533db5153978c4
msgid ""
"It would not be defensible to conclude that management caused half of C's "
"shortfall and the operating environment caused the other half. The "
"multiplication is an efficiency account, not a causal decomposition. Claims "
"about causes, treatment effects, or the gains from a policy intervention "
"need a separate identification strategy and evidence about transition costs "
"and institutional feasibility."
msgstr ""
"不能据此断言管理造成了 C "
"绩效不足的一半，运营环境造成了另一半。乘法关系是一项效率核算，而不是因果分解。关于成因、处理效应或政策干预收益的判断，需要另外的识别策略，以及有关转型成本和制度可行性的证据。"

#: ../../chapters/07-heterogeneity/23-metafrontier.md:367
#: 82e691a3f84d4cd3bf220081d2176e61
msgid ""
"Finally, the six-organization dataset is a theory-led laboratory rather than"
" evidence about an actual sector. In an empirical study, comparable "
"missions, harmonized quantities, defensible ex ante groups, and "
"institutional knowledge are part of the analysis itself. Metafrontier DEA is"
" most informative when it preserves that context: it allows organizations to"
" be compared on a common scale without pretending that all of them began "
"with the same opportunities."
msgstr ""
"最后，这个六组织数据集是理论驱动的实验案例，不是某个真实行业的经验证据。在实证研究中，可比的使命、口径协调的数量、站得住脚的事前群组和制度知识，本身就是分析的一部分。共同前沿"
" DEA 只有在保留这些背景时最有信息价值：它允许不同组织在共同尺度上比较，同时不假装它们最初拥有完全相同的机会。"
